00:01:02.110 --> 00:01:03.980
at the University of Toronto,

00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:05.920
where he is currently still based

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:09.200
while directing the Angkor Vihara Project,

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:11.810
which is a collaboration
between Cambodia's ops

00:01:11.810 --> 00:01:13.400
