00:48:07.640 --> 00:48:09.540
and then I'll call on
you and I'll keep a list

00:48:09.540 --> 00:48:11.150
as they start appearing

00:48:11.150 --> 00:48:13.683
to try to get an order to our questions.

00:48:15.260 --> 00:48:18.400
So, I'll wait for a moment as
people collect their thoughts

00:48:18.400 --> 00:48:20.350
and I look forward to hearing from you.

00:48:21.875 --> 00:48:24.080
And so we'll start with Eric White,

00:48:24.080 --> 00:48:24.923
Eric, go ahead.

00:48:26.510 --> 00:48:29.010
- Hi, hi Andrew, thank you for the talk.

00:48:29.010 --> 00:48:33.820
So I'm not a specialist of
