- I work on

00:48:35.190 --> 00:48:38.090
contemporary Thai, Thailand Thai Buddhism.

00:48:38.090 --> 00:48:40.600
So my question is more comparative

00:48:40.600 --> 00:48:42.742
sort of builds off of your,

00:48:42.742 --> 00:48:45.590
some of your closing comments and it's...

00:48:47.260 --> 00:48:48.782
It's said in this,

00:48:48.782 --> 00:48:50.130
I'm often concerned that there is,

00:48:50.130 --> 00:48:52.660
