00:48:55.740 --> 00:48:57.633
and histories across the region.

00:48:58.780 --> 00:48:59.860
You know, they all,

00:48:59.860 --> 00:49:01.740
rather than thinking about multiple

00:49:01.740 --> 00:49:03.570
Theravada Buddhisms in the region,

00:49:03.570 --> 00:49:07.910
there's often a kind of a tendency

00:49:09.150 --> 00:49:14.150
