00:49:17.860 --> 00:49:19.850
So, in that light

00:49:22.382 --> 00:49:23.240
how do you see

00:49:23.240 --> 00:49:28.240
the character and dynamics
of the introduction

00:49:28.270 --> 00:49:33.270
and consolidation of
Theravada Buddhism in Cambodia

00:49:33.440 --> 00:49:36.990
differing from dynamics

00:49:39.727 --> 00:49:42.677
of the introduction of Theravada
Buddhism in other regions,

00:49:44.380 --> 00:49:47.280
right, or other polities in this,

00:49:47.280 --> 00:49:49.780
