00:49:49.780 --> 00:49:50.963
You sort of mentioned,

00:49:51.890 --> 00:49:55.631
you gestured towards these
unique local character,

00:49:55.631 --> 00:49:57.103
and I'm wondering if you could actually,

00:49:59.100 --> 00:50:01.440
if you could sort of itemize even,

00:50:01.440 --> 00:50:03.830
just list out what you saw,

00:50:03.830 --> 00:50:05.710
what you see as uniquely

00:50:05.710 --> 00:50:07.683
in terms of the character and dynamics.

00:50:08.940 --> 00:50:12.629
And especially if you see them
