00:50:18.240 --> 00:50:20.430
the way that initial differences

00:50:20.430 --> 00:50:23.860
have had enduring consequences, thank you.

00:50:23.860 --> 00:50:25.220
- That's a great question.

00:50:25.220 --> 00:50:28.480
I think, I think coming
from my perspective,

00:50:28.480 --> 00:50:31.996
which is more archeological
than anthological,

00:50:31.996 --> 00:50:34.080
I can't necessarily talk to
the rites and rituals involved.

00:50:34.080 --> 00:50:35.710
The inscriptions are lacking.

00:50:35.710 --> 00:50:39.190
