01:07:09.580 --> 01:07:13.640
In terms of Jayavarman

01:07:13.640 --> 01:07:18.640
and the introduction of
Theravada by way of Mahayana,

01:07:18.800 --> 01:07:20.190
I think, as I mentioned,

