01:07:55.870 --> 01:07:57.200
And so that creates a flood gate,

01:07:57.200 --> 01:07:59.610
as well as if populations were
being absorbed under that,

01:07:59.610 --> 01:08:00.820
under that in Germany.

01:08:00.820 --> 01:08:03.461
Again, speculative and
needs more archeology,

01:08:03.461 --> 01:08:06.780
